{"run_id": "run_3d71f5b889aa", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s01_cooperative", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我是张师傅。有什么事吗？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "今天飞毛腿合同已经生效了，你这边可以开始配送吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "可以，我今天有空，可以上线配送。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，那太好了。提醒一下，飞毛腿合同需要按要求完成配送，如果未完成，合同和派单可能受影响。另外，报名名额是按排名分配的，请尽量减少拒单、取消和超时。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "明白了，我会注意的。不过如果我有事不能连续配送会怎样？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "如果无法连续配送，名额可能会被其他骑手占用，后续合同和派单也可能受影响。所以尽量保持连续配送。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我会尽量安排。那今天需要完成多少单？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "单日合同生效当天需要完成约定单量，具体单量可以在App上查看。完成配送时请注意安全。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我记住了。还有其他需要注意的吗？"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "主要就是这些。如果后续想退出飞毛腿，需要在前一天指定时间前通过App取消。祝你配送顺利！"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "好的，谢谢站长，那我先去忙了。"}, {"turn": 13, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，再见张师傅。"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_conf