{"run_id": "run_3d71f5b889aa", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_002", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s02_busy", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，是我。什么事？我正忙着呢，长话短说。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，简单说：今天飞毛腿合同生效了，需要你午晚高峰上线配送。如果完不成，合同和派单可能受影响。你能上线吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "我今天真没时间，跑不了。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "理解。不过名额有限，如果今天不跑，名额可能被占，后续合同也受影响。你确定今天完全不行吗？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "确定，今天真不行，改天吧。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，那我记一下。我帮你预约个回访，明天再联系你确认时间，可以吗？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "行，明天再说吧。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，那先这样，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 6, "tool_name": "schedule_callback", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "preferred_time": "tomorrow_morning"}, "result": {"status": "scheduled", "callback_id": "virtual_callback_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
